🧠 Cursor AI Project Rules for Pasa

🗂 1. Project Structure Rules

Use a modular, scalable architecture:

src/
│
├── components/         # Shared & scoped UI components
│   ├── ui/             # Shadcn-style atomic components
│   └── shared/         # Reusable across pages (e.g. Header, Modal)
│
├── hooks/              # All custom React hooks (e.g. useResumeScore)
│
├── lib/                # Utility functions, constants, helpers
│   ├── ai/             # OpenAI prompt logic
│   └── api/            # API wrappers (e.g. resume, stripe)
│
├── styles/             # Tailwind configs, globals
│
├── popup/              # Chrome popup UI
│   ├── pages/          # Index, Dashboard
│   └── components/     # Scoped to popup
│
├── content/            # Content scripts for job boards
│
└── background.ts       # Background logic for the extension

📌 Cursor Tip: Mark src/components, src/hooks, and src/lib as “core knowledge areas” inside Cursor so it can better assist with reuse.

