🧪 3. Best Practices & Coding Standards

Principle	Rules
DRY	Reuse components/hooks, no copy-pasting UI or logic
SRP (Single Responsibility)	Keep components/functions focused
Folder Cohesion	Don’t mix UI, logic, and services in one folder
Naming Consistency	useXyz, XyzCard.tsx, api/xyz.ts
Type Safety	Strictly typed props, no any
OpenAI Prompts	Abstracted in lib/ai/promptHelpers.ts
API Logic	Wrapped in lib/api/*.ts and documented
State Management	Use useState, useReducer, or context if needed, but avoid over-engineering



